---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Writes a new deployment signing key and prints its public key

Usage: leptoskit verify keygen [OPTIONS] --out <OUT>

Options:
      --app-target <NAME>  Select a named target from the root leptoskit.toml
      --out <OUT>          A new file for the private key, readable only by you
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
